    "notes": "Another long one... but it's worth it I promise. That being said, make sure you **PAY ATTENTION TO THE ADJUSTMENTS** so you don't have to start over\n\n*Heal with Wonder as needed between Mediarama and other healing items like Recov-R L and Takemedic-All V. What is listed in the rotation is suggestions based on what I had to do* \n\n**ADJUSTMENTS**\nA2+ Miku: \nBreak 1: Dion Tarukaja\nBreak 2: Vasuki Mataru\nBreak 3: Dion Rebellion\nBreak 4: Dion Tarukaja\n\nA6 Kotone: Double GFB on Break 2 - S1 > S3 > S2 > (Berry HL) S2 > S1\n\nA0 Kotone: Kotone HL Break 2 after her S1. Berry HL instead of Twins HL on Break 3\n\nA6 Twins: Button on Turn 1, Turn 18, and Break 3",
    "credits": "Gibus",
